an></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">菊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>菊花</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">絞</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>勒紧；拧绞；榨取；勒死</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しぼ.る・し.める・し.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">絞る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しぼる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拧；绞（毛巾、抹布）；挤；榨取（果汁）；挤压；提取；挤奶；绞尽（脑汁）；竭力（发声）；敲诈；剥削；严厉斥责；痛骂；教训；怒斥；责骂；批评；严格训练；灌输；缩小范围；逐步削减；筛减；聚拢（窗帘等）；拉紧（绳子等）；缩小光圈；调低（收音机等音量）；拉（弓）；弯弓；（相扑）夹紧对手；勒住；使对方动弹不得；（围棋）挤；弃子紧气（使对方棋形凝重）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">縁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>缘分；边缘；关联；契机；（器物等的）边</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン・-ネン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふち・ふち.どる・ゆかり・よすが・へり・えにし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">命运；宿命（指神秘地将两人联系在一起的力量）；关系；纽带；联系；连接；亲缘；姻亲关系；亲属关系；机缘；相识的机会；缘（间接条件，相对于直接原因）；狭长的露天走廊；檐廊</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁側</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんがわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缘侧；日式传统建筑外侧的外廊；鱼鳍基部的骨头（尤指比目鱼）；鱼鳍基部的肉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁談</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">婚事；婚谈；提亲</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">唯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>仅仅；只；单纯地；唯一</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ユイ・イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ただ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">唯一</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆいいつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">唯一；仅有；独一</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">膨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>膨胀；鼓起；发胀；肿胀；隆起</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふく.らむ・ふく.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">膨大</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぼうだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">巨大；广阔；庞大；浩瀚；膨胀；扩张；肿胀</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">膨らむ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくらむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">膨胀；膨大；肿胀；鼓起；增大</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">膨らます</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくらます</span><span class=\"k-wz\">使膨胀；使扩张；使充气；使鼓起</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">矢</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>箭；镖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">や</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">矢印</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やじるし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">箭头符号；（对某人的）心意；指向</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">矢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">や</span><span class=\"k-wz\">箭；楔子；木楔</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">矢鱈に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やたらに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">randomly；recklessly；blindly</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">耐</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>耐性；忍耐；耐久</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">耐える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">忍耐；承受；经受；支撑；承受；抵御；顶住；胜任；能担当</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">塾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>补习学校；私塾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">塾</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">补习班；私塾；培训学校</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">漏</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>漏出；泄漏；逃脱；时间流逝</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も.る・も.れる・も.らす</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漏る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漏出；泄漏；渗漏</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漏らす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もらす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漏出；泄露（如光线）；泄露；透露（秘密）；泄密；披露；说漏嘴；发出（如不满）；倾诉；表达；流露（如真实意图）；发出（叹气等）；尿裤子；失禁；遗漏；漏掉；疏忽做；错过；漏做；忘记做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漏れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漏出；逸出；透出；滤出；得以表达；发泄；泄露；被披露；被公开；遗漏；被遗落；被排除；未被包含</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">慶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>庆贺；喜悦；欢喜</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よろこ.び</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">猛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>凶猛；狂暴；猛烈；迅猛；强烈</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">モウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">猛烈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうれつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">凶猛；激烈；剧烈；猛烈；强烈；汹涌澎湃；可怕；令人害怕；非常；极其；异常；完全</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">芳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>芳香；芬芳；有利；好评</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かんば.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">懲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>惩罚；惩戒；教训；责罚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こ.りる・こ.らす・こ.らしめる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">懲りる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こりる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">从经历中学到教训；吸取教训；经历挫折后有所领悟；感到灰心（而却步）；深感厌倦；厌烦透顶</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">剣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>剑；刀；刃；指针（钟表）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つるぎ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">真剣</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">认真；严肃；真刀（相对于木制练习用刀）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">彰</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>明显；清楚</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">棋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>将棋；围棋；棋子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ご</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">将棋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">将棋；日本象棋</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">丁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>街区；（豆腐等）块；（菜肴）份；偶数；天干第四位</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ・テイ・チン・トウ・チ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひのと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丁寧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていねい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">礼貌；仔细</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">庖丁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">菜刀；厨刀；烹饪；食物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丁目</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">町内的分区；城市街区</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">恒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>恒常；恒定；经常</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つね・つねに</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>"]